# section: pars secunda, per diminutionem [46-66] — the talea at half values. Raw quotes stretch less at speed, so the chant audibly sharpens from organ-wash into a bird: diminution as coming-into-focus.
# text @b46: the same 35 calls, the same order, twice the speed
